# Three Men and a Closet's Ratihb replies against The Die Is Cast's available 591 (Progress; Luck of the Draw completed,
# whose own 552 is silenced by the Stage var of Equipped for All Occasions): 840 (Progress, Prog 2) ties with it and the
# two rotate, 841 (Event, Prog 3) loses to it. Each trigger's finish begins The Die Is Cast or moves Prog, so the states
# are reset between the triggers (task 8 review lesson: a lone reply at an NPC without a script shows no kind). The
# trace order line says who is first.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Ratihb/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=75,-6,-137 job=WAR lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.LuckOfTheDraw completed
charvar Quest[6][24]Stage 1
quest AhtUrhgan.ThreeMenAndACloset accepted
login
charvar Quest[6][31]Prog 2
trigger Ratihb                          # Prog 2: 840 (Progress) and 591 (Progress)
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.TheDieIsCast available
charvar Quest[6][31]Prog 2
trigger Ratihb                          # the second
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.TheDieIsCast available
charvar Quest[6][31]Prog 2
trigger Ratihb                          # the third
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.TheDieIsCast available
charvar Quest[6][31]Prog 3
trigger Ratihb                          # Prog 3: 841 (Event) against 591 (Progress)
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.TheDieIsCast available
trigger Ratihb                          # the second
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.TheDieIsCast available
trigger Ratihb                          # the third
finish
